// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : B.O.T.L.E.R. 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3559021502" "B.O.T.L.E.R."
// ProfessionString :
"P153710237" "Hero Alignment Merit Vendor and Butler Extraordinaire"
// DescriptionString :
"P1472662474" "This is the description of BOTLER"
// LocationString :
"P1481808866" "Fort Trident"
// HelloString :
"P1097992599" "Hello."
// HelloString :
"P3135390668" "Hi."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2014967038" "Gracious me!  It seems that I am experiencing the oddest of errors at this moment."
// IntroString :
"P612594318" "There's someone I want you to meet.  Here is their contact information.  I think you would be inclined to work with them."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3751841202" "Meet New Contact"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3776541590" "This contact I have introduced you to can probably move you along down the path you have chosen."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3342444154" "I have got someone I think you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P30252022" "There are a couple of people you should talk to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P809762470" "It's a pleasure to see you, good {Hero.gender=Male sir|madam}.  At the risk of repeating myself, I beg that you excuse the mess around this simple abode as we continue to construct what I'm assured will be a grand domicile.  In the meantime, perhaps I might be able to offer you various accoutrements to enhance your already impressive prowess?"
// Answer Text :
"P2854484417" "What do you have to offer?"
// Answer Text :
"P174568276" "Thank you, B.O.T.L.E.R, but I need nothing at this moment."
// Page HAMInfo Text :
"P2159809835" "Goodness gracious, I have quite a variety of odds and ends that might fit to your liking, {Hero.gender=Male good sir|dear lady}.  Someone of your caliber would be inclined to peruse the coffers directly behind me.  I'm certain that the oeuvre of your heroic deeds will match with these modern-day bezoars in a most serendipitous manner.<br><br><color orange>You hear a whirring from B.O.T.L.E.R.'s head, accompanied by his eyes flashing for a brief moment and Positron's voice speaking through B.O.T.L.E.R.</color><br><br>Lexicon Algorithm Parser Error - ScriptCall PositronBroSpeak LanguageSet FailSafe.<br><br><color orange>B.O.T.L.E.R.'s voice resumes back to normal.</color><br><br>Dude... you can totally find all kinds of sweet things, but you're gonna need to trade your Hero Merits for them.  Peace out."
// Answer Text :
"P322854967" "Thanks!  And have Positron take a look at your programming when you get a chance, okay?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


