// Page HelloPage Text :
"P2268961884" "Oh, {HeroName}!  How do you like the place we've set up?  I mean, it'll be a while before the place looks up to what the Freedom Phalanx should be working from - but hey... It's a start.  And did you meet my little robotic creation, B.O.T.L.E.R.?"
// Answer Text :
"P4139710891" "Are there any pressing issues at hand I can help with?"
// Answer Text :
"P2445108845" "I'll go look at BOTLER right now."
// Page PositronPortal Text :
"P1555909102" "It's a good thing you showed up when you did.  If you and several others you trust meet me on the other side of that portal beside me, I can tell you more.  Once there, you can assemble at taskforce and we can take care of this problem!"
// Answer Text :
"P2822722805" "Okay, I'll meet you there, Positron!"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


