// Page HelloPage Text :
"P3789794996" "It's good to see you, {HeroName}.  Though it took a lot of convincing, Positron managed to get me to see how having a place like this would help us in our fight against those who would harm Paragon City.  His idea of calling it Fort Trident makes up for his insistence towards keeping that robotic parody of a butler around, though."
// Answer Text :
"P2316933447" "Do you know of anything perilous that needs attending to?"
// Answer Text :
"P980521172" "Together we'll see to it that Paragon City is safe."
// Page StatesmanPortal Text :
"P1275260739" "Actually, yes, there's something that needs to be corrected.  I'll need you and several others to meet me on the other side of town.  Step through the portal beside me and I'll meet you there.  From there, you can assemble the team and we can take care of this problem once and for all."
// Answer Text :
"P1608606927" "I'll meet you there, Statesman!"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


