// Page HelloPage Text :
"P47354883" "Howdy! {HeroName}, right?  I've heard of ya!  Been doing good work is what they've been saying!<br><br>Glad to have you hanging out with us down here.  Sometimes you just gotta blow off some steam, don't ya know?"
// Answer Text :
"P2241638755" "You mean there's nothing pressing we need to take care of?"
// Answer Text :
"P2905503844" "Only as long as Paragon City doesn't need us at that moment, Synapse."
// Page SynapsePortal Text :
"P3529647023" "Oh, there is.  I'm just taking a breather.  Perfect timing on your part to show up when you did, though, seeing that I could use your help.  You and several friends meet me on the other side of the portal beside me and I can give you the details.  From there you guys can assemble a taskforce to take care of this problem once and for all."
// Answer Text :
"P2426531232" "Okay, I'll meet you there, Synapse!"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


