"P3498842523" "Trashcan"
// ProfessionString :
"P250784857" "Villain Alignment Merit Vendor and Stinkmonger"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
// HelloString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4115373479" "I shouldn't be saying this line."
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P84445030" "<color orange>This rather scurrilous individual looks alarmed as you approach him.  Even behind the layers of what looks like a protective mask you can still see what amounts to sheer terror in his eyes.<color /orange>"
// Answer Text :
"P1263399634" "HEY!  What are you up to back here?"
// Page TrashcanLie Text :
"P3694499024" "Oh... Um... Hi!  I'm just... Um... Checking the air conditioning.<br><br><color orange>Trashcan looks around quickly, as if working out an escape plan.</color orange><br><br>Yup... Been conditioning this air for hours... You know how it goes.  The overlord... um... the foreman says, 'Hey!  Condition that air for all those really nice and forgiving heroes!'... and um, you gotta do it, you know?"
// Answer Text :
"P3271506908" "What's in that trashcan there?"
// Page WhatTrashcan Text :
"P2524780431" "Oh, this old thing? It's... umm... where I keep all the bad air that I, uh, conditioned.  You know, the kind of air that... um.... stinks really, really bad?  Like sour feet or, um, moldy cheese, or um, rest-stop bathrooms?  Yeah, yeah... That's what's in there.<br><br><color orange>Trashcan starts fidgeting at speeds you had no idea possible.</color><br><br>You might want to stay away from it, or um, people might stop saying 'Look!  Up there!  It's the really nice and powerful and nice {HeroName}!'.  Instead, they might say, 'OH MY GOSH WHAT DIED IN YOUR COSTUME!?'"
// Answer Text :
"P3244640521" "Hmmmm... Maybe I'll just, um, leave you to your work."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

